  "description": "AsiBackbone 7.1.0 is a backward-compatible minor release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It adds analyzer rule ASIB004 for signing requests that omit SignatureInput, deprecates legacy signature-input creation through ASIB902, deprecates the outbox RetryClock override through ASIB903, and preserves opt-in verification of historical pre-6.0 signatures. Package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0 remain unchanged.",
